Package: MethylOmniData
Type: Package
Title: Versioned Model and Reference Data for MethylOmni
Version: 0.2.1.9000
Authors@R: person("MethylOmni", "Development Team", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "methylomni@example.org")
Description: Provides versioned coefficient tables and reference matrices used
    by MethylOmni. Each resource is accompanied by source, checksum, and
    redistribution metadata. This development snapshot separates data from the
    lightweight computational package.
